OL,3,GNEWSACommunity condemn AI mural as
OL,4,A'insult' to artists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community have expressed their
OL,7,Foutrage at an AI-generated mural, which
OL,8,Fhas appeared in an area renowned for
OL,9,Fits vibrant street art scene.
OL,11,FThe vinyl sticker on the side of the
OL,12,FJolly Colliers pub in Bedminster,
OL,13,FBristol, features hot air balloons
OL,14,Falongside iconic city landmarks like
OL,15,Fthe Clifton Suspension Bridge.
OL,17,FA letter from an unnamed member of the
OL,18,Fcommunity was found taped to the
OL,19,Fbuilding and described it as a
OL,20,F"disrespectful affront" to a city full
OL,21,Fof creatives, and accused the owners of
OL,22,F"laziness".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
