OL,3,GNEWSACommunity condemn AI mural as
OL,4,A'insult' to artists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Punch Pubs & Co.,
OL,7,Fwhich owns the pub, said the mural is a
OL,8,F"temporary solution" and that they will
OL,9,Fbe working with local artists to
OL,10,Freplace it soon.
